  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64f88707fe1514b2a0a18b7f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "优胜者是%h_rank_l1！\\n精彩地制胜群英月赛 LONG，\\n立于优骏的顶点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aec59f3e794641b200d2c75ae41b32ffab2423ed45ef5189e0e4da732dc5d56",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2a2fc71d3a71ca5208ffcf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "优胜者是%h_rank_l1！\\n她以与顶点相符的奔跑，\\n在长途马娘们的激战中制胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53b198aae3aea556dc7efbb7aa77c101b793e12e2e4694fa7cb92c850c69b0c6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac773c3dd0e27bdb71f1d72",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "决定优骏中的最强者的比赛，\\n群英月赛 SPRINT决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd85f55d1083f325ff786859d944c7689115c0e8f197ee45e5b7d8935f6167c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c33088ce9626a94fefe12893",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在这大舞台中脱颖而出，夺得荣冠的赛马娘会是谁！\\n群英月赛 SPRINT决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a62eb5b9074aa0234ff1d05c317afb276fff038e5f255874c1794ef11b9b38",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c64dda4cb30060e147c1ea",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_a1%h_rank_to2\n互不相让",
      "source_fingerprint": "c33125d366a01dc324656608423091ef6a533f98d36720b98f1525b3ffe1a17c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "905"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e14cc2245cba152b6dfd4bf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_l1！\\n超越了众多强豪，\\n赢得群英月赛 SPRINT胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d61c48347c8a24330b4b86b96e72aad77acd6a13e14512d1e889295a2f203110",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192019e9570cc08195d9178c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n漂亮地赢得最后一场比赛，\\n获得最速短跑者的荣冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1e060e28e0321ae55cb8c3630e27cd576364227fc46018e4fa1346b5fba1e6f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39a33c2787d11a362b874e93",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "被誉为世界最美竞马场之一的\\n圣安妮塔公园竞马场\\n哪位赛马娘将在此证明自己的实力呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7caf0f994d5b4d68956b22a7f8c541b631e8520d21ea057d73dd9e9d6e75a266",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9160690db31bedb4c352684",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "晴朗天空下开始的\\n%course，\\n%ground%distance %h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "7419fe1ca7213015354660c088a0fa13fb543bc195dbcdb1c189406f60190748",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f12d6667e5f2bfd9548da653",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "各赛马娘，沿山坡赛道下坡\\n进入主直线赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c3fcba568c347b0595d3ab108d18b3753e6d1000b2842f5b61e2a94ce4bd35d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d2a53541e5e76349bfea7cb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "穿过沙土赛道进入环形赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6aabb5292fe0446d2585df525f7782e1b00f1639be446e07a82f0c83a7764b8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efb877d48a29ed6f8666df16",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在雄伟的圣加布里埃尔山脉的注视下\\n赛马娘们向后直线赛道前进",
      "source_fingerprint": "53238dc4088ae8f05d99e9232769009bc8d45c44e67aa18e6a8444be3e011a9f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da2038b28ef6715649fa165c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是%h_rank_ta1！\\n精彩地拿下圣安妮塔公园小弯道赛道\\n充分发挥出了自己的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "777a5e505d5af37ab91c2055a755d2dc54f39efe9967c8d0ffb02cc0db62fe7b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4a3f406b2f79abf0f2dfe2c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "众星云集的比赛，Dream Fest Stella\\n其中对此刻速度引以为傲的赛马娘们\\n已在此集结！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f71140fa71e335292706c9d84a21afc2846ff1f2d99cad909d15d288ae2d1df6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65a2cbaad8fe58c3b335dfaa",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "仅靠速度无法胜出的英里赛！\\n兼具速度与强韧的赛马娘们\\n正在挑战Dream Fest Stella的舞台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60cc07cae77f8e9b64c0dd7f3caa06d1abc2e2c26c9890ccd4223fcee3758db5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c94497294091c1570b0e12",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%a_h_rank1领先\\n第二名，第三名也紧跟不放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e7eb438cb2e259bcd9cbf1ab3e03da10c1eec885bda2b8f44f9beb27cd2984",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "906"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250b2d76cefe96511d481d2e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "速度与耐力双重考验的\\nDream Fest Stella\\n为了胜利的荣冠，新星们正激烈角逐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8970476bc3a933201e157cf306d84bedb2daf5c4d8e6a1f4740d5f0b679c44c2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb58651969f1cdd573ee4a9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在沙土的大舞台上，泥地新星们齐聚一堂\\nDream Fest Stella！\\n发挥出年轻的才华，哪位赛马娘将成为最闪耀的一颗星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b5b3406698698d942ff61f8659899138421ad059ec5984e9a2e89aefb777e99",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bdff5ce075f6430cdf344ec",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜出的是%h_rank_ta1\\n展现出了格外耀眼的光芒，\\n制霸了Dream Fest Stella！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4191862ddb19d5064292702e8ccf3f21582c136d8a2f8796a874c1aef4ace5b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f16ffaef2f214ed388e1ef1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "为了证明自己才是最快，\\n被选中的短途健将们在此集结\\nDream Fest Pride现已拉开帷幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d61ddec3ecfecba38e7c500374d858b19ce87ceb0a8d630cc3fcca5dfe004a2b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df4aa0487a8d8ae3fc9e8dfd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "引以为傲的快足赛马娘们齐聚一堂\\nDream Fest Pride！\\n英里王者的称号将花落谁家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7545a089c8256d45a9e2fb278945d6264e37505dc3e19990bba8de06c5fa4612",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d03908c5666829f7cb1bde4e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "精锐们正角逐着速度与耐力\\nDream Fest Pride！\\n哪位赛马娘将夺得胜利的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16a7443ca1bdce3e072515f3c5101dd43f345248d5521cbd38dadc6963f6bd99",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2006981a5f17eb169cd3d0ce",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在众多数赛马娘中，对耐力自信的选手集结于此！\\n在Dream Fest Pride中成为长距离霸者的\\n会是哪位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "814b537351bafbf5a6d31bcf8ad74ffcdda8555d14af8449f72e3cffb61ae1d9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d103107b8f827d14e73f57da",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "沙土的精锐们汇聚一堂\\nDream Fest Pride！\\n展现骄傲并君临王者之位的会是哪位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f59028ea8a7d7459bbed8653e72d0663a5e6a70fa7c97a3cfbb740457133ef",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7fd0368e13b9a05beb00ae0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第一是%h_rank_l1\\n出色地制霸了Dream Fest Pride！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9330dcc5237b0f46101b3cba23d56294199f643e9f0fecd60498d58ef3dcc9b2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc34bfb5ef05a414a6a47b6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "出类拔萃的短途健将们汇聚一堂！\\nDream Fest Legend！\\n不容眨眼的刹那之争，胜出的会是哪位赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2c3dc141608909c82d39608adf8e71323ad62a48598748bf1c8e3e1382b22e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dff180cdacc354a7efd1e252",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "最前方是%a_h_rank1\\n但第二名，第三名也紧跟不放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f5cca773d26fa74dbb27777eff4ada357707cfb37fbab80365bf18f9e40f46",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "907"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d868505d7d59706b54a6dcac",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "以英里赛顶峰为目标，名将云集！\\nDream Fest Legend！\\n究竟哪位赛马娘能抵达顶点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a484b0784dc88398cde70d6dfc6813ad4907ae70d9e5a45ccda4d2083306cc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e91e6201b18d3161bb79f4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "速度、耐力，各方面皆为\\n超一流的赛马娘们齐聚Dream Fest Legend！\\n这场必将激斗的一战，绝不容错过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b2a863eb308a3c4c830bfcbe6d10ed7435c19815f420a3767458bdc4e9aae89",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1bb5c0c0be080f0284434a1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "声称自己才是最强长距离选手的\\n赛马娘们齐聚Dream Fest Legend！\\n制霸这条长路的会是哪位赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "145ce2bbdcd9a462e1e2f9b03824c13d520649df30c1c468da5d51caaa216676",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea9b829632981a72ea8eb6c5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "为了决出沙土王者，精锐们正集结于此！\\nDream Fest Legend！\\n拨开尘沙，摘取荣光的会是哪位赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bb32bc57ab77c95c20ef263ce83b1c550bac0635208fd40f45237475ff6c1d0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4ec9fbec9a4bf0dd8a69694",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "仅有强者集结的舞台，Dream Fest Legend！\\n跨越闪电参战的活着的传说——圣列特，\\n最终证明自己才是最强的究竟是谁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c6e10f773455bcbcb4773575e87a2a6d155091f4333f1891a26d21645a2c570",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e778331e53c3c076c0a37f5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "为了挑战曾经开创时代的速度象征，\\n精锐们在Dream Fest Legend集结了！\\n在这场大舞台上化身传说的究竟会是哪位赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdfbe898d297454d53fba149c1a13ad0062bd6a6e010cf8d8062b70f244a3ccc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a03e7229c7fcb903424baf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "为了超越曾经被称为“第一星”的海塞克，\\n赛马娘们正在Dream Fest Legend集结\\n绽放出最强光芒的究竟会是哪位赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac2aa46691004399179737885f50e44bd0b294feb278e3c1cf23ea742744dfa5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5ff59fad870e78bc90f94a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "以当下备受瞩目的赛马娘杏目为中心，\\n顶级实力者云集的Dream Fest Legend\\n究竟哪位赛马娘将成为新的传说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f50bfeb6054a973f6d2ba3fbbddeeed224412980ea0450c29096f72dcd939204",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:149fa85f38a9b6fd855c000b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜出的是%h_rank_ta1\\n新的传说现已在此诞生！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4828eb07b41b60f38020a6938c05169ac2a76376babca682a34e3c06db067059",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ce018148f3ca43758cc01e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是杏目！\\n真是不折不扣的奇幻赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7f088a26259d5931f7cfe5f7252ef85d127c5db6add5bb925cfa665860264de",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e43656f5ad4a3611a9b12605",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank1，领先！\n不过她与第二名，第三名的差距很小",
      "source_fingerprint": "73995601ed2617eae233869ef2e5c6bf9ed82fe94cb9ca65067d42bf31b56acf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "908"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41335bd4f4b0e4df618e8b7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "好了，今天的主角舍她其谁\\n第1人气%a_h_pop1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "deb01716b933c51cd1f4e8c4b9936d7bcb7f63eabbc580fb38479784f50c10c1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f41d9494b4fb4b9fc20bc1e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "威风凛凛等待起跑的是这位赛马娘\\n今日的第1人气%a_h_pop1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "989ada5c31732173d86ac1404e87dd977c7d6d82de6030ade13417d04a13506b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9081"
      ]
    },
